1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,629
We hit an asteroid. Now we've gone back to look.

2
00:00:04,283 --> 00:00:09,675
In 2022, NASA crashed a spacecraft
into Dimorphos, on purpose.

3
00:00:10,283 --> 00:00:12,402
Its orbit got 33
minutes shorter.

4
00:00:12,402 --> 00:00:15,128
But what happened
to the rock itself?

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:16,942
Scientists argued.

6
00:00:16,942 --> 00:00:17,563
A crater?

7
00:00:17,563 --> 00:00:18,390
A new shape?

8
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:20,120
Or no change at all?

9
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,091
Now Europe's Hera
has sent the answer.

10
00:00:23,091 --> 00:00:24,070
All three.

11
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,199
One face is flattened,

12
00:00:26,199 --> 00:00:29,342
into a crater as big
as a sports stadium.

13
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:31,283
It's tumbling wildly.

14
00:00:31,283 --> 00:00:33,792
But the rest of
it looks the same.

15
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:37,348
And hundreds of boulders
are flying around it.

16
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,000
Practice, for protecting Earth.
